  "ref": "ACT.13.1",
  "review_notes": [
    "Corrected ὁ καλούμενος (s017/s018): the accepted reading gave *that* to the article under rule 90, but Συμεών is an expressed head noun that the article follows, which is rule 31's `τὸν καλούμενον` → *which is called* and which rule 90 excludes in terms. The article is now unrepresented and *that was called* is the participle's, headed on *called*.",
    "τὴν οὖσαν ἐκκλησίαν is the other side of the same rule: there the article precedes its noun, so it keeps *the* and the participle keeps the relative clause."
  ]
